# McGreer et al. (2018, AJ 155, 131), Table 1 ("Binned QLF"), "SDSS Stripe 82" block; checked against arXiv:1710.09390v1
# Sample: SDSS Stripe 82 quasars of McGreer et al. (2013) plus five additional spectroscopically confirmed quasars, re-analysed
# Redshift: 4.7 < z < 5.1 (mean z ~ 4.9; file labelled z ~ 5 as in the paper)
# Magnitude definition: M1450 (bin centres spaced by 0.55 mag)
# Phi convention: linear Phi in units of 1e-9 cMpc^-3 mag^-1 (H0 = 70, Om = 0.272, OL = 0.728)
# Note: The paper tabulates log10(Phi / Mpc^-3 mag^-1) but gives sigma_Phi in linear units of 1e-9 Mpc^-3 mag^-1.
# Note: The central values were exponentiated (10**(logPhi + 9)); the tabulated linear sigma_Phi (Gehrels 1986 approximation) is kept unchanged.
# Note: This supersedes the Stripe 82 points of McGreer et al. (2013) (entry McGreer2013); do not use both as independent data.
# Note: The paper determines the binned QLF separately for SDSS Main, SDSS Stripe 82 and CFHTLS Wide (see McGreer2018_SDSS, McGreer2018_CFHTLS);
#       it gives no combined binned QLF.
#
# M1450  Phi  Delta
